{
	"_readme": [
		"The Barred Gate, played start to finish by a script.",
		"",
		"This is the gate that makes the second game real rather than merely present. It boots a",
		"DIFFERENT game (--game=quest, taken from the directory this file sits in), is refused by",
		"a locked door, finds the key, is let through, lights the lantern, and walks back to a",
		"warden who then says something she could not have said before.",
		"",
		"That last beat is the only part of this game that is code. Everything else - three maps,",
		"a palette, a gate, a stash that opens once, seven conversations - is data the template",
		"already knew how to read.",
		"",
		"WALK INTO THINGS, DO NOT COUNT TO THEM. Almost every move here ends against a wall, a",
		"bush or the warden's own body, because a body stopped by a collider lands on the same",
		"pixel every time while a frame count lands wherever walk_speed happens to be today.",
		"",
		"The one thing that genuinely bit while writing this: a held direction SURVIVES a warp.",
		"Walking west into a door keeps walking west in the map you arrive in, so a long hold",
		"is only safe when the far side ends against something solid - which is why the routes",
		"below aim at walls rather than at tiles."
	],
	"steps": [
		{ "op": "wait", "frames": 10 },
		{ "op": "assert_state", "state": "world" },
		{ "op": "assert_map", "map": "quest_village" },
		{ "op": "assert_flag", "key": "has_gate_key", "expect": false },
		{ "op": "assert_position", "tile": [5, 5] },

		{ "op": "note", "text": "the warden stands at [5,3]; walk north until her body stops us" },
		{ "op": "hold", "action": "move_up", "frames": 60 },
		{ "op": "release_all" },
		{ "op": "wait", "frames": 3 },
		{ "op": "press", "action": "interact" },
		{ "op": "wait", "frames": 20 },
		{ "op": "assert_state", "state": "dialog" },
		{ "op": "press_until_state", "action": "interact", "state": "world", "limit": 40 },

		{ "op": "note", "text": "east along row 5 into the barred gate" },
		{ "op": "hold", "action": "move_down", "frames": 30 },
		{ "op": "release_all" },
		{ "op": "wait", "frames": 3 },
		{ "op": "hold", "action": "move_right", "frames": 200 },
		{ "op": "release_all" },
		{ "op": "wait", "frames": 10 },
		{ "op": "assert_state", "state": "dialog" },
		{ "op": "press_until_state", "action": "interact", "state": "world", "limit": 40 },

		{ "op": "note", "text": "refused: still in the village, still no key" },
		{ "op": "assert_map", "map": "quest_village" },
		{ "op": "assert_flag", "key": "has_gate_key", "expect": false },

		{ "op": "note", "text": "west through the other door; the hold carries us into the hollow's west wall" },
		{ "op": "hold", "action": "move_left", "frames": 400 },
		{ "op": "release_all" },
		{ "op": "wait", "frames": 5 },
		{ "op": "assert_map", "map": "quest_hollow" },
		{ "op": "assert_position", "tile": [1, 4] },

		{ "op": "note", "text": "three tiles east, then south until the bush stops us" },
		{ "op": "hold", "action": "move_right", "frames": 60 },
		{ "op": "release_all" },
		{ "op": "wait", "frames": 3 },
		{ "op": "hold", "action": "move_down", "frames": 60 },
		{ "op": "release_all" },
		{ "op": "wait", "frames": 3 },

		{ "op": "note", "text": "open the stash - an object, not a person" },
		{ "op": "press", "action": "interact" },
		{ "op": "wait", "frames": 20 },
		{ "op": "assert_state", "state": "dialog" },
		{ "op": "press_until_state", "action": "interact", "state": "world", "limit": 40 },
		{ "op": "assert_flag", "key": "has_gate_key", "expect": true },

		{ "op": "note", "text": "and it opens once: pressing again does nothing at all" },
		{ "op": "press", "action": "interact" },
		{ "op": "wait", "frames": 20 },
		{ "op": "assert_state", "state": "world" },

		{ "op": "note", "text": "back to the village door - 30 frames, not 40: 40 lands at y=63.1, which floors into the row ABOVE the one the door is on" },
		{ "op": "hold", "action": "move_up", "frames": 30 },
		{ "op": "release_all" },
		{ "op": "wait", "frames": 3 },
		{ "op": "hold", "action": "move_right", "frames": 140 },
		{ "op": "release_all" },
		{ "op": "wait", "frames": 5 },
		{ "op": "assert_map", "map": "quest_village" },

		{ "op": "note", "text": "the same gate, now that we are carrying the key" },
		{ "op": "hold", "action": "move_right", "frames": 400 },
		{ "op": "release_all" },
		{ "op": "wait", "frames": 5 },
		{ "op": "assert_map", "map": "quest_keep" },

		{ "op": "note", "text": "the hold left us against the keep's east wall; three tiles back west" },
		{ "op": "hold", "action": "move_left", "frames": 60 },
		{ "op": "release_all" },
		{ "op": "wait", "frames": 3 },
		{ "op": "hold", "action": "move_up", "frames": 40 },
		{ "op": "release_all" },
		{ "op": "wait", "frames": 3 },
		{ "op": "press", "action": "interact" },
		{ "op": "wait", "frames": 20 },
		{ "op": "assert_state", "state": "dialog" },
		{ "op": "press_until_state", "action": "interact", "state": "world", "limit": 40 },
		{ "op": "assert_flag", "key": "lit_the_lantern", "expect": true },

		{ "op": "note", "text": "back through the gate, short enough not to carry on into the hollow" },
		{ "op": "hold", "action": "move_left", "frames": 120 },
		{ "op": "release_all" },
		{ "op": "wait", "frames": 5 },
		{ "op": "assert_map", "map": "quest_village" },

		{ "op": "note", "text": "north wall, east wall, west wall: three walls to stand on a known pixel" },
		{ "op": "hold", "action": "move_up", "frames": 400 },
		{ "op": "release_all" },
		{ "op": "wait", "frames": 3 },
		{ "op": "hold", "action": "move_right", "frames": 400 },
		{ "op": "release_all" },
		{ "op": "wait", "frames": 3 },
		{ "op": "hold", "action": "move_up", "frames": 400 },
		{ "op": "release_all" },
		{ "op": "wait", "frames": 3 },
		{ "op": "hold", "action": "move_left", "frames": 400 },
		{ "op": "release_all" },
		{ "op": "wait", "frames": 3 },
		{ "op": "assert_position", "tile": [1, 1] },

		{ "op": "note", "text": "four tiles east puts us in the warden's column; south finds her" },
		{ "op": "hold", "action": "move_right", "frames": 80 },
		{ "op": "release_all" },
		{ "op": "wait", "frames": 3 },
		{ "op": "hold", "action": "move_down", "frames": 400 },
		{ "op": "release_all" },
		{ "op": "wait", "frames": 3 },
		{ "op": "assert_position", "tile": [5, 3] },

		{ "op": "note", "text": "the line only the game's own code can reach" },
		{ "op": "press", "action": "interact" },
		{ "op": "wait", "frames": 20 },
		{ "op": "assert_state", "state": "dialog" },
		{ "op": "press_until_state", "action": "interact", "state": "world", "limit": 40 },
		{ "op": "assert_state", "state": "world" },
		{ "op": "assert_map", "map": "quest_village" }
	]
}
